{"id":"e6af0200f99b76e3","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-var.md","title":"迭代量词块变量类 VAR","display":"df-var — 迭代量词块变量类 VAR","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-var","aliases":["29-df-var"],"display":"df-var — 迭代量词块变量类 VAR","depends_on":["[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 10.14, p.163, DjVu scan 178","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-var"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-var</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-var — 迭代量词块变量类 VAR"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 10.14, p.163, DjVu scan 178"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\">\\(v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，输入带内建序及其端点。</li>\n<li>输入为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span>，满足关系作用于扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau(U)\">\\(E_\\tau(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 的域大小，而非其二进制编码长度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a> 定义的固定量词块迭代查询类，允许固定数量的额外布尔变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VAR}[v,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^{v-1}},v,\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VAR}[v,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^{v-1}},v,\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 10.14，印刷页 163，扫描页 178。本条命名为 df-var，与迭代量词块变量类的内容一致；它并非“至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 个变量名的任意 FO(PFP) 句子”。原书 Theorem 10.16 的精确空间等式使用此定义并单独计数布尔变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"输入为 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]] 的 $U=(A,L)\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau$，满足关系作用于扩张 $E_\\tau(U)$；$n$ 表示 $|A|$ 的域大小，而非其二进制编码长度。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]$ 为 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]] 定义的固定量词块迭代查询类，允许固定数量的额外布尔变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\tau(U)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VAR}[v,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^{v-1}},v,\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false}],"bytes":1634,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-var]]、[[29-thm-dspace-var]] — 迭代量词块 VAR、ITER 与空间层次"},{"id":"f84a2a81864368f1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VAR}[v,\\tau]$ 与 [[29-df-var]] 为同一接口；下式重述其指数迭代上界，不声明另一种有限变量 FO(PFP) 语法。"},{"id":"73e3feb902982212","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VAR}[k+1,\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-var]]；$\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau^\\uparrow]$ 见 [[29-df-iter]]。$\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau^\\uparrow]$ 见 [[29-df-bool-query]]。"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-var]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-var]]"}],"outgoing":["7174257cf5cba5d4","4f651c8d1bdc9a58"]}